    "intro": "Split dye hair color is the ultimate way to express your unique personality through your tresses. This bold trend involves parting the hair down the center and applying two distinct, often contrasting, colors to each side. It has taken social media by storm, especially on Pinterest, where users look for striking visual inspiration that breaks traditional beauty norms. Whether you want a high-contrast look like the iconic Cruella de Vil or something more subtle with pastel hues, split dye offers endless possibilities. It works beautifully on all hair textures, from pin-straight locks to bouncy natural curls. Choosing the right color combination is key to making this style work for your specific skin tone and personal fashion sense.",
