      "Split dye hair color is the ultimate way to express your unique personality through your tresses. This bold trend involves parting the hair down the center and applying two distinct, often contrasting, colors to each side. It has taken social media by storm, especially on Pinterest, where users look for striking visual inspiration that breaks traditional beauty norms. Whether you want a high-contrast look like the iconic Cruella de Vil or something more subtle with pastel hues, split dye offers endless possibilities. It works beautifully on all hair textures, from pin-straight locks to bouncy natural curls. Choosing the right color combination is key to making this style work for your specific skin tone and personal fashion sense.",
      "Have you ever wanted to channel your inner villain with a look that screams high fashion and edgy sophistication?Black and white split dyeis perhaps the most iconic version of this trend, offering a stark contrast that instantly draws the eye. This look requires a very high level of lifting on one side to achieve a crisp, clean white or platinum tone. The other side remains a deep, rich black to create that famous monochromatic balance. It looks incredible when styled in a sleek bob or long, flowing waves. Maintenance involves using purple shampoo on the light side to prevent yellowing. This color choice is perfect for anyone who wants to make a definitive style statement."
