        "title": "Pastel Sunrise Hair Color Blend",
        "image": "/images/doc_b20_7_img_9.jpg",
        "description": "Pastel sunrise hair color is a dreamy, whimsical option that mixes pale pink, lavender, peach, and soft yellow in one airy blend. It often requires pre-lightening your hair to a very light blonde so the pastel pigments show up softly and evenly. Once the base is ready, your colorist can place different pastels in panels, slices, or a seamless melt so the colors flow together like a watercolor sunrise. This look works especially well on medium to long hair, with wavy or curly textures adding even more dimension. Because pastels fade faster than deeper shades, you will need to baby your hair: wash less often, use cool water, and choose a gentle, sulfate-free shampoo and conditioner. Color-depositing conditioners in your main pastel tone help refresh the hue. Be prepared for more frequent salon glossing and touch-ups if you want to keep the blend perfectly balanced and bright.",
