        "description": "For something more unexpected, sunrise purple and copper hair brings together cool and warm tones in one striking look. You might see deeper violet or plum at the roots that gradually shifts into copper, amber, and golden orange toward the ends. This combination mimics those rare sunrises where the sky holds both purple shadows and fiery light at the same time. It looks especially beautiful on medium to long hair and can be customized to be more subtle or bold. Because purple and copper have very different base tones, you need a skilled colorist who can blend them without muddying the result. Maintenance includes using a sulfate-free shampoo and alternating between purple-safe and copper-safe color conditioners to keep both sides of the palette vibrant. Styling with loose curls, braids, or space buns helps show off the different shades from every angle.",
