        "title": "Sunrise Ombre Hair Color",
        "image": "/images/doc_b20_7_img_7.jpg",
        "description": "Sunrise ombre hair color is for anyone who loves a dramatic gradient that clearly shifts from dark to light, like watching the sky change at dawn. It often starts with deeper roots—think chocolate brown, dark copper, or even soft black—then melts into vivid oranges, pinks, and golden blondes toward the ends. Unlike subtle balayage, ombre is meant to showcase that contrast while still blending smoothly. This look is especially striking on medium to long hair, because the added length gives more room for color transitions. Ask your stylist to keep the root color close to your natural shade for easier maintenance, while focusing the brightest sunrise tones from mid-lengths down. You can choose bolder fiery shades or softer pastel versions depending on your comfort level. At home, a nourishing mask keeps lightened ends healthy, and a color-safe shampoo helps prevent the vibrant ombre from fading too quickly.",
