        "description": "Midnight navy hair color on wavy hair gives you the best of both worlds: deep, moody color and plenty of soft movement. The natural bends and S-shapes in wavy hair catch the light at different angles, revealing the blue undertones on the outer curves while the inner sections remain inky and shadowy. This interplay creates a subtle, dimensional effect without needing lighter highlights, although you can certainly add them if you want even more contrast. Loose beach waves, created either with heat tools or air-dry products, are especially flattering with this shade, because they showcase both the shine and the color variation along each strand. Protecting your waves with hydrating leave-in products, minimizing heat, and using navy-friendly color care will keep your texture defined and yourdeep blue tonesrich instead of dull or brassy.",
