        "image": "/images/doc_b20_12_img_5.jpg",
        "description": "A short bob in midnight navy hair color looks modern, sharp, and surprisingly versatile for different face shapes. The clean lines of a bob help show off the richness of navy-black tones, and the shorter length keeps the look edgy instead of heavy, which is ideal if you love bold color but prefer a low-fuss cut. Whether your bob is slightly A-line, blunt, or softly layered, the dark base can be customized with cooler navy focus around the perimeter and ends to highlight movement and shine. Styling this look with a smooth blowout makes the color appear mirror-like, while adding a slight bend or loose waves helps reveal the blue dimension as the hair shifts during the day. Shorter hair also makes maintenance easier, because trims remove dry ends quickly and you can refresh the entire head with less dye and shorter processing times.",
