        "title": "Colorful Cord Braid Space Buns",
        "image": "/images/doc_b19_4_img_12.jpg",
        "description": "Colorful cord braid space buns involve weaving bright embroidery thread or leather cords into the braids as you create them. This technique adds a rustic, handmade feel to the hair, reminiscent of traditional friendship bracelets. As the corded braids are twisted into buns, the colors create a marbled or striped effect within the knot. This is a great way to incorporate your festival’s specific color palette into your look. The cords also add a bit of extra grip to the hair, making the braids less likely to slip or loosen over time. It is a creative, low-cost styling hack that provides a significant visual upgrade to standard braids, making them look unique and artisanal.",
