        "title": "Butterfly Clips Festival Hairstyle",
        "image": "/images/doc_b19_7_img_16.jpg",
        "description": "Butterfly clipsare a nostalgic accessory that has fully returned for festival hair, adding instant charm to simple bases like waves, braids, or pigtails. You can scatter mini clips along the hairline, stack them along a part, or place them down the length of a braid for pops of color. This approach works on almost any hairstyle, which makes it ideal if you like to keep your hair routine simple but still want something eye‑catching. Butterfly clips are lightweight and comfortable, so they are easy to wear all day without pulling or causing headaches. They also work with many textures, from straight to coily hair, as long as you anchor them into a bit of texture or teased areas. For a more cohesive look, match the clip colors to your outfit, makeup, or even wristbands so everything feels tied together.",
