        "title": "Medium Hair With Pastel Rainbow Hues",
        "image": "/images/doc_b19_8_img_11.jpg",
        "description": "Medium hair withpastel rainbow huesis made for anyone who wants a full fantasy look at a rave. This style usually involves bleaching the hair to a light blonde, then applying soft pastel shades—like lilac, baby blue, mint, and peach—in sections or melted together for a seamless effect. On medium‑length cuts, the colors blend beautifully when styled in waves or loose curls. The result is a dreamy, cotton‑candy vibe that stands out both in daylight and under UV or stage lighting. Because pastels tend to fade quickly, you’ll want to use gentle, color‑safe products and space out washes. At the rave, you can enhance the color with light‑reflecting hair oils and glitter gel at the roots. Keep heat styling minimal and always use a protectant, since pre‑lightened hair can be more prone to dryness and breakage.",
