        "title": "High Ponytail With Silver Braids",
        "image": "/images/doc_b19_8_img_9.jpg",
        "description": "A high ponytail with silver braids is a cool, futuristic option that looks amazing with reflective or metallic outfits. To get this look, hair is slicked up into a high pony and then braided with silver or gray extensions, which can be done as one thick braid or several smaller ones. The result is a long, shimmering tail that moves dramatically and catches every bit of light in the venue. This style is particularly practical because it keeps your hair up and away from sweat while still making a big visual statement. People with naturally dark hair get a striking contrast, but silver tones also look soft on lighter bases. Use a firm gel or styling cream at the roots for a glassy finish and secure everything with strong elastics. If you’re worried about weight, opt for thinner braids or shorter extensions to keep the style comfortable.",
