        "image": "/images/doc_b19_8_img_8.jpg",
        "description": "A Dutch braid mohawk with an undercut is for women who want something fierce and high impact for a rave or EDM show. The look features buzzed or very short sides and back, with longer hair down the center braided into a chunky Dutch braid that runs from the forehead to the nape. This creates a dramatic, faux‑hawk silhouette that stays completely off your face and neck while you dance. It works best on straight to wavy textures and medium density, though you can also add extensions into the braid for extra length or thickness. Because the undercut and any bright color on top require regular maintenance, this is more of a lifestyle look than a one‑night style. Use a strong styling wax or pomade on the braid to keep flyaways smooth, and consider adding metallic cuffs or ribbons along the braid for extra rave flair.",
