        "description": "Braided pigtails with neon extensions are a fun, sporty rave hairstyle that frames the face and looks great from the back. The hair is parted down the middle and braided into two long braids—either Dutch, French, or three‑strand—with neon extensions added from roots to ends. This creates a bold contrast between your natural hair and the bright artificial colors. It’s a great choice if you want your hair completely controlled, since the braids won’t whip into your face while you dance. This look suits straight to wavy textures and most densities, especially when a bit of grip spray is used before braiding. Choose neon shades that complement your outfit or accessories, like lime green, hot pink, or electric blue. After the event, undo the braids gently and apply a moisturizing mask to counter any dryness from styling products.",
