        "image": "/images/doc_b19_8_img_17.jpg",
        "description": "A sleek high ponytail with glitter part gives you a sharp, polished base with a little sparkle running through the center. The hair is brushed and gelled up into a high ponytail, with the part line (or a zigzag part) painted with glitter mixed into gel. The ponytail itself can be straight, wavy, or extended with clip‑ins for extra drama. This style is perfect if you like clean lines and minimal fuss but still want a rave twist. It works best on medium to long hair and can be adapted for fine hair using lightweight extensions. Use a boar bristle brush and high‑hold gel for that glass‑smooth finish at the roots, then seal with hairspray. Make sure you’re using cosmetic‑grade glitter so it’s safe for the scalp, and rinse it out gently with a clarifying shampoo after the event.",
