    "intro": "Whether you are dancing under the desert sun or lounging in a grassy meadow, 20 boho festival waves hairstyle looks offer the perfect blend of effortless charm and artistic flair. This iconic aesthetic focuses on natural movement, touchable texture, and a sense of “undone” beauty that thrives in the energetic atmosphere of a music festival. By combining loose, heat-styled waves withintricate braids, sparkling accessories, or even a hint of shimmer, you can create a personalized hair statement that lasts from the first set to the final encore. Embracing these bohemian-inspired trends allows you to celebrate your individuality while maintaining a low-maintenance style that only looks better as the day turns into night.",
    "introParagraphs": [
      "Whether you are dancing under the desert sun or lounging in a grassy meadow, 20 boho festival waves hairstyle looks offer the perfect blend of effortless charm and artistic flair. This iconic aesthetic focuses on natural movement, touchable texture, and a sense of “undone” beauty that thrives in the energetic atmosphere of a music festival. By combining loose, heat-styled waves withintricate braids, sparkling accessories, or even a hint of shimmer, you can create a personalized hair statement that lasts from the first set to the final encore. Embracing these bohemian-inspired trends allows you to celebrate your individuality while maintaining a low-maintenance style that only looks better as the day turns into night.",
      "Small, thin braids placed right at the front of the hairline are the ultimate way to add a playful bohemian touch to loose texture. This style involves parting your hair down the center and selecting two very small sections to braid tightly, leaving the rest of your hair in relaxed, air-dried waves. It is a nod to nostalgic trends while remaining perfectly modern for any outdoor event. To keep the look cohesive, ensure the waves are not too uniform; a little frizz or grit actually adds to the charm. You can secure the tiny braids with clear elastics or even let them fade out naturally toward the ends for a more carefree and whimsical finish."
    ],
    "isFeatured": false,
