      "Copper ginger balayage on dark brown hair creates a striking contrast that feels both modern and sophisticated. This specific look uses bright metallic copper ribbons strategically placed through the mid-lengths and ends of a deep brunette base. Because dark brown hair provides a cool or neutral foundation, the warmth of the copper pops brilliantly, adding immediate life to the strands. The balayage technique ensures that the roots remain dark, which makes the grow-out process incredibly easy to manage. It is a perfect option for anyone wanting to brighten their face without lifting their entire head of hair to a lighter level. When styled in loose waves, the copper highlights catch the light and emphasize the hair’s natural texture and movement."
