          "The transition is usually kept very soft to avoid harsh lines. This look is all about luminosity and brightness, providing a “halo” effect around the face.",
          "It is a daring style that works well for those who love to experiment with their hair. Using a deep conditioning mask once a week is vital to keep the lightened ends healthy and shiny."
