        "image": "/images/doc173_img_13.jpg",
        "imageAlt": "Caramel Brunette Hair With Money Piece - Caramel Brown Hair Color",
        "description": "A caramel brunette hair color with a “money piece” is perfect if you want face‑brightening drama with minimal lightening elsewhere. The money piece is a bold, lighter section\n\nor pair of sections at the front hairline that frames your face and creates instant pop in photos.",
        "paragraphs": [
          "A caramel brunette hair color with a “money piece” is perfect if you want face‑brightening drama with minimal lightening elsewhere. The money piece is a bold, lighter section\n\nor pair of sections at the front hairline that frames your face and creates instant pop in photos.",
          "On a rich brunette base, acaramel or honey caramel money pieceadds contrast but stays within\n\nthe warm, wearable family. This works on\n\nstraight, wavy, or curly hair and looks especially striking when you pull your hair half up or into a ponytail because the lighter front pieces stand out.",
          "Ask your colorist to blend the money piece back into the rest of your hair with softer, smaller highlights so it does not look like a stripe, and maintain it with targeted toning glosses as needed."
        ]
