    "excerpt": "Dark pink hair is having a major moment 💖 From rich berry shades to vivid magenta blends, this color family brings personality without feeling overdone.",
    "description": "Dark pink hair is having a major moment 💖 From rich berry shades to vivid magenta blends, this color family brings personality without feeling overdone.\n\nAD Some styles lean glossy and polished.\n\nOthers add texture, layers, and a little edge. Either way, dark pink gives classic cuts a fresh update with plenty of dimension.\n\nIf your current hair routine feels a little too “same old, same old,” this might be the color refresh your mirror has been waiting for.\n\nBonus: it pairs surprisingly well with messy buns and dry shampoo days. Bright dark pink and fuchsia tones bring bold dimension\n\nto these loose medium-length waves. The glossy finish keeps the vivid color looking rich and polished while the soft texture adds movement throughout the style.\n\nA modern shag cut paired with dark raspberry pink creates a relaxed yet artistic finish.\n\nFeathered layers and airy fringe give the style extra shape while the deeper pink tones add depth and contrast. Smooth, long layers showcase a seamless blend of dark magenta and vibrant pink ribbons.\n\nThe silky styling enhances the reflective shine and gives the color placement a soft flowing effect. This chin-length bob combines a rich brunette base with dark pink panels for a playful contrast.\n\nSide-swept bangs and textured ends give the style a fresh and youthful finish. A shoulder-length lob styled with loose waves pairs beautifully with plum\n\nberry pink coloring. The darker base softens the brighter pink sections, creating a balanced dimensional result.\n\nA layered wolf cut with black roots and dark pink face-framing pieces creates strong contrast and edgy texture. Choppy layers around the crown\n\nadd volume while the vivid pink accents brighten the entire look.\n\nDark burgundy melts into rich pink balayage pieces for a multidimensional color effect. Soft waves emphasize the placement and give the darker pink tones extra richness.\n\nDeep wine pink coloring paired with long flowing waves creates a polished salon finish.\n\nThe darker pink shades shift beautifully in the light, adding softness and shine to the full-bodied style.\n\nThis medium-length layered cut features dark pink highlights blended into a rich brunette base. The sweeping layers keep the color looking soft and natural while adding movement around the face and ends.\n\nA softly layered bob comes alive with dark pink ribbon highlights placed throughout the hair.\n\nThe rounded shape and bouncy styling give the overall look a smooth and dimensional appearance. Rich dark pink coloring with velvet-inspired shine gives these soft waves a polished salon\n\nfinish. The layered styling adds fullness and movement while brighter pink accents create extra dimension\n\nthroughout the hair. Long layered hair paired with berry pink coloring creates a smooth and dimensional effect.\n\nLoose waves soften the overall style and highlight the depth of the darker pink tones from\n\nroot to ends.",
