          "The contrast draws immediate attention\n\nto your face and creates a striking visual frame that feels bold yet wearable. You can\n\ngo for a lighter, icy denim blue money piece against a dark base for high contrast, or use a medium\n\ndenim tone against a lighter base for a softer effect.",
